{:edb/db-before-t 2512 :edb/db-after-t 2513 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535825 50 #inst "2026-10-15T00:07:56.018Z" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186133891 1038 #edb/ref 17592186530652 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186133891 1040 #edb/ref 17592186530659 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530652 1068 #edb/ref 17592186530654 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530652 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530652 1071 "![](images/1b/1b693165c8f6201e96f0a972746324c65a308d1f143f229c465b6aa22b7aeb16.png)\n\nWhich of the following is equivalent to ${\\int }_{C}5\\left((x-y)\\right)\\,\\text{d}x,$ where $C$ is the path along the ellipse $16{x}^{2}+25{y}^{2}=400,$ traversed from the point $(0,-4)$ to the point $(5,0),$ as shown above?\n*Hint: Use the parametrization $r(t)=⟨5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩.$*" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530652 1072 #uuid "06e31152-0f29-5cdd-9766-cb494216c61b" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530652 1074 "We will use the formula\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(r(t))\\,\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\n \n\nThe curve $C$ can be parameterized as \n\n$$\nr(t)=⟨5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t⟩,\\,\\frac{3\\pi }{2}\\le t\\le 2\\pi .\n$$\n\nComputing $\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},$ we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t)=-5\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $f(x,y)=5\\left(x-y\\right)$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(r(t)) & =5\\left(5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write the integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\int }_{3\\pi /2}^{2\\pi }f(r(t))\\,\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =5\\left({\\int }_{3\\pi /2}^{2\\pi }(5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)(-5\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\,\\text{d}t\\right)\\\\  & =5\\left(-5{\\int }_{3\\pi /2}^{2\\pi }(5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t\\right)\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530653 1080 "5\\left(-10{\\int }_{3\\pi /2}^{2\\pi }(5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t\\right)" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530653 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530653 1083 #uuid "304925d3-7e53-5fe7-8e1e-d1a597888552" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1075 #edb/ref 17592186530653 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1075 #edb/ref 17592186530655 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1075 #edb/ref 17592186530656 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1075 #edb/ref 17592186530657 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1075 #edb/ref 17592186530658 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1077 "selection" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1078 #edb/ref 17592186530658 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530654 1079 #uuid "4db95f3e-81e0-5b82-b974-5027285c9250" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530655 1080 "5\\left(-10{\\int }_{3\\pi /2}^{2\\pi }(5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t\\right)" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530655 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530655 1083 #uuid "654e7f30-de76-5ae3-8bbd-6b7df7e6bc6a" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530656 1080 "5\\left(4{\\int }_{3\\pi /2}^{2\\pi }(5\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t\\right)" 13194139535825 17592186045443 true] [17592186530656 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535825 17592186045443 true]